Turnbull</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Moulding</surname><given-names>NT</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>IG</given-names></name><name><surname>Holtmann</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Andrews</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Does psychological status influence clinical outcomes in patients with inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) and other chronic gastroenterological diseases: An observational cohort prospective study</article-title><source>Biopsychosoc Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>11</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18538012</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1751-0759-2-11</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bonicatto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dew</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Soria</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Seghezzo</surname><given-names/></name></person-group><article-title>Validity and reliability of symptom checklist '90 (SCL90) in an Argentine population sample</article-title><source>Soc Psychiatry Psychiatr Epidemiol</source><year>1997</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>332</fpage><lpage>338</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9299927</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF00805438</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schmitz</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Hartkamp</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiuse</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Franke</surname><given-names>GH</given-names></name><name><surname>Reister</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Tress</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-titl